    "detailed_description": "<h1>Follow the Development</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1750137817\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/dc12c8bfc6999b6b2f2308754d470f63.avif?t=1750137817\" /></div>A catastrophic event has shattered a powerful spirit, splitting it into two smaller beings and scattering its immense power across the world. Bound by their shared purpose, the two spirits must embark on a journey to reclaim what has been lost. Take control of both characters simultaneously as you solve challenging puzzles, overcome trials, and uncover the hidden truth behind their shared destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/d6719a5e148334a6c25a055ee16bd8c4.poster.avif?t=1750137817\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/d6719a5e148334a6c25a055ee16bd8c4.webm?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/d6719a5e148334a6c25a055ee16bd8c4.mp4?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/dd3aaf269353cb6da5bdc5e462c4d16e.avif?t=1750137817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simultaneously guide two spirits with the same movement keys, solving unique puzzles along the way. As one moves, the other follows - together, they must navigate the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/e9c358c7a44802f0bb0317e90dac16aa.poster.avif?t=1750137817\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/e9c358c7a44802f0bb0317e90dac16aa.webm?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/e9c358c7a44802f0bb0317e90dac16aa.mp4?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/78103829561587c0528286e02340c4ab.avif?t=1750137817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore stunning, hand-crafted environments, each brimming with detail and unique atmospheres. Every chapter unfolds its own captivating story, inviting you to discover hidden secrets and experience a world that feels alive with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/855b5e1d388deb3565dbdb4173fd7ca6.poster.avif?t=1750137817\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/855b5e1d388deb3565dbdb4173fd7ca6.webm?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/855b5e1d388deb3565dbdb4173fd7ca6.mp4?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/1d2aa8f54332a2e37e5193a3e554a5a4.avif?t=1750137817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and unlock new abilities throughout your journey, each offering fresh, creative ways to approach and solve the challenges you\u2019ll encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/352ae006d00665c6f1166c4120fdb7be.poster.avif?t=1750137817\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/352ae006d00665c6f1166c4120fdb7be.webm?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/352ae006d00665c6f1166c4120fdb7be.mp4?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/dc12c8bfc6999b6b2f2308754d470f63.avif?t=1750137817\" /></div>A catastrophic event has shattered a powerful spirit, splitting it into two smaller beings and scattering its immense power across the world. Bound by their shared purpose, the two spirits must embark on a journey to reclaim what has been lost. Take control of both characters simultaneously as you solve challenging puzzles, overcome trials, and uncover the hidden truth behind their shared destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/d6719a5e148334a6c25a055ee16bd8c4.poster.avif?t=1750137817\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/d6719a5e148334a6c25a055ee16bd8c4.webm?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/d6719a5e148334a6c25a055ee16bd8c4.mp4?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/dd3aaf269353cb6da5bdc5e462c4d16e.avif?t=1750137817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simultaneously guide two spirits with the same movement keys, solving unique puzzles along the way. As one moves, the other follows - together, they must navigate the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/e9c358c7a44802f0bb0317e90dac16aa.poster.avif?t=1750137817\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/e9c358c7a44802f0bb0317e90dac16aa.webm?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/e9c358c7a44802f0bb0317e90dac16aa.mp4?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/78103829561587c0528286e02340c4ab.avif?t=1750137817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore stunning, hand-crafted environments, each brimming with detail and unique atmospheres. Every chapter unfolds its own captivating story, inviting you to discover hidden secrets and experience a world that feels alive with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/855b5e1d388deb3565dbdb4173fd7ca6.poster.avif?t=1750137817\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/855b5e1d388deb3565dbdb4173fd7ca6.webm?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/855b5e1d388deb3565dbdb4173fd7ca6.mp4?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/1d2aa8f54332a2e37e5193a3e554a5a4.avif?t=1750137817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and unlock new abilities throughout your journey, each offering fresh, creative ways to approach and solve the challenges you\u2019ll encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/352ae006d00665c6f1166c4120fdb7be.poster.avif?t=1750137817\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/352ae006d00665c6f1166c4120fdb7be.webm?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/352ae006d00665c6f1166c4120fdb7be.mp4?t=1750137817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
